{"seq":1,"slug":"carrier-scorecard-model","title":"承运商记分卡模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-performance-management/scorecard-grading/carrier-scorecard-model","wordCount":2135,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"承运商记分卡模型\">承运商记分卡模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>记分卡把第一章产出的十几个原始指标压缩成一个可以横向比较、可以驱动决策的分数。它借鉴平衡计分卡的基本思路——用一小组围绕目标挑选的财务与非财务指标，每个对照一个目标值，而不是泛泛地收集所有能收集的数（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Balanced_scorecard\">平衡计分卡</a>），把&quot;四个视角&quot;换成&quot;时效 / 质量 / 数据 / 成本&quot;四组。</p>\n<p>数学上这只是加权求和，难的是四件事：指标方向不一致（达成率越大越好、破损率越小越好）；量纲不一致（百分比、天、金额混在一起）；样本量差异巨大（12 票与 5000 票被同等对待）；以及承运商差异有很大一部分来自<strong>线路结构而非自身能力</strong>。四件事逐一处理，否则记分卡只会把结构性差异错判成能力差异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始指标] --&gt; B[方向对齐&lt;br/&gt;全部转为越大越好]&#10;  B --&gt; C[尺度归一&lt;br/&gt;映射到 0-100]&#10;  C --&gt; D[样本可靠性加权&lt;br/&gt;小样本向中位数收缩]&#10;  D --&gt; E[维度内聚合]&#10;  E --&gt; F[维度间汇总&lt;br/&gt;加权和 / 几何平均]&#10;  F --&gt; G[记分卡总分]&#10;  G --&gt; H[分级&lt;br/&gt;见分级与份额动态调整]&#10;  E --&gt; I[维度分&lt;br/&gt;用于短板诊断]\">graph TD\n  A[原始指标] --&gt; B[方向对齐&lt;br/&gt;全部转为越大越好]\n  B --&gt; C[尺度归一&lt;br/&gt;映射到 0-100]\n  C --&gt; D[样本可靠性加权&lt;br/&gt;小样本向中位数收缩]\n  D --&gt; E[维度内聚合]\n  E --&gt; F[维度间汇总&lt;br/&gt;加权和 / 几何平均]\n  F --&gt; G[记分卡总分]\n  G --&gt; H[分级&lt;br/&gt;见分级与份额动态调整]\n  E --&gt; I[维度分&lt;br/&gt;用于短板诊断]</pre><h2 id=\"归一化-方向与尺度\">归一化：方向与尺度</h2><h3 id=\"方向对齐\">方向对齐</h3><p>指标必须先统一方向。对&quot;越小越好&quot;的指标（破损率、丢失率、每公斤成本、轨迹时延），有两种处理方式：取倒数，或取补。取倒数会放大极小值的影响（破损率 0.01% 的倒数远大于 0.02%），因此更稳妥的方式是针对每个指标定义一个<strong>可接受上限</strong> <code>$x_{bad}$</code> 与<strong>理想值</strong> <code>$x_{good}$</code>，再做线性补映射：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = 100 \\times \\mathrm{clip}\\!\\left(\\frac{x*{bad} - x}{x*{bad} - x\\_{good}},\\; 0,\\; 1\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.446em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">clip</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">oo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>上限与理想值的选取来自业务承诺（例如破损率上限 2%、理想 0%），而不是数据的最大最小值——用数据的极值做归一化会让权重随样本漂移，同一个承运商的分数在下个月因为别人变差而上升。</p>\n<h3 id=\"尺度归一\">尺度归一</h3><p>不同量纲的指标要映射到同一区间才能加权。可选的两种经典方法是极值归一与标准化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><mi>σ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&#x27; = \\frac{x - \\min(x)}{\\max(x) - \\min(x)}, \\qquad x&#x27;&#x27; = \\frac{x - \\bar x}{\\sigma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>极值归一产出有界值但完全由数据中的两个极端点决定，一个异常值会压缩其余所有的分布；标准化产出零均值单位方差的分布、对异常值更稳健，但不有界（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Feature_scaling\">特征缩放</a>）。承运商记分卡通常选择极值归一，因为它需要<strong>绝对有界</strong>的分数以便与分级阈值挂钩（例如&quot;80 分以上为 A 级&quot;）；代价是必须用业务定义的上限/理想值而不是数据极值，这也正是上一步的做法。标准化则更适合下游还要做聚类或回归的场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"权重怎么定\">权重怎么定</h2><p>权重政治敏感度最高——权重一变，排名就变。四条可行路径，各有适用条件与风险：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路径</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>专家赋权</td>\n<td>由采购/运营按经验分配</td>\n<td>可解释、可谈判</td>\n<td>主观、易被游说</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AHP 成对比较</td>\n<td>两两比较建构权重</td>\n<td>一致性可检验</td>\n<td>比较次数随维度平方增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>熵权法</td>\n<td>按指标离散度客观赋权</td>\n<td>无主观输入</td>\n<td>奖励噪声大的指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果反推</td>\n<td>用业务结果（复购、投诉）回归</td>\n<td>与业务价值对齐</td>\n<td>需要足够历史数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>AHP 的成对比较</strong>在维度不多（4–6 个）时非常实用。它用 Saaty 的 1–9 标度把两两相对重要性写成互反矩阵 <code>$A = (a_{ij})$</code>，<code>$a_{ii}=1$</code>，<code>$a_{ji}=1/a_{ij}$</code>，用主特征向量作为权重。关键是它能检验一致性：<code>$\\mathrm{CI} = (\\lambda_{\\max}-n)/(n-1)$</code>，<code>$\\mathrm{CR} = \\mathrm{CI}/\\mathrm{RI}$</code>，其中 <code>$\\mathrm{RI}$</code> 是同阶随机矩阵的平均一致性指标；习惯上 <code>$\\mathrm{CR} \\le 0.10$</code> 视为可接受（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Analytic_hierarchy_process\">层次分析法</a>）。AHP 在记分卡场景的真正价值不是算出权重，而是<strong>逼出讨论</strong>——一旦发现某两个维度的相对重要性判断不一致，就说明团队对目标本身没想清楚。</p>\n<p><strong>熵权法</strong>从另一个方向定权重：指标的离散度越大，说明它越能区分承运商，就给它越高的权重。它完全不需要主观输入，看起来客观，但有一个致命副作用——<strong>它会奖励噪声大的指标</strong>。一条样本稀疏的线路偶发的极端值会让该指标的离散度虚高，从而被赋予不该有的权重。熵权法适合作为专家赋权的对照而非替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"汇总方式-加权和与几何平均\">汇总方式：加权和与几何平均</h2><p>维度分数汇总成总分有两种主流方式，选择决定了记分卡的&quot;性格&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>sum</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>S</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>geo</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∏</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S*{\\text{sum}} = \\sum_k w_k s_k, \\qquad S*{\\text{geo}} = \\prod_k s_k^{w_k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sum</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">geo</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1507em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>加权和是可补偿的：一个维度差但其他维度好，总分仍然高。几何平均不可补偿（严格说是弱可补偿）：任何维度接近 0 就把总分拉向 0。跨境物流的实操经验是<strong>低分维度必须显著影响总分</strong>——一家破损率极低但丢失率高的承运商不应因为&quot;平均下来还不错&quot;而拿到好等级，因为丢失对客户的破坏远大于轻微延迟。</p>\n<p>折中的做法是分层：维度内用加权和，维度间用加权几何平均，并对每个维度设一个及格下限，低于下限时直接降级而不参与平均。这样既保留了算术上的平滑，也保留了不可逾越的短板惩罚。任何权重方案的长期风险都是<strong>古德哈特定律</strong>——当分数与利益挂钩，承运商会优化分数而非真实表现，这需要在看板层设置反作弊机制（见<a href=\"../performance-feedback-loop/carrier-performance-dashboard\">承运商绩效看板与复盘</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scorecard&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2026-Q3&quot;,&#10;    &quot;dimensions&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;key&quot;: &quot;transit&quot;,&#10;        &quot;weight&quot;: 0.35,&#10;        &quot;aggregate&quot;: &quot;weighted_sum&quot;,&#10;        &quot;floor_score&quot;: 60,&#10;        &quot;metrics&quot;: [&#10;          { &quot;key&quot;: &quot;otd_rate&quot;, &quot;dir&quot;: &quot;higher&quot;, &quot;good&quot;: 0.98, &quot;bad&quot;: 0.85, &quot;w&quot;: 0.7 },&#10;          { &quot;key&quot;: &quot;otd_wilson_lower&quot;, &quot;dir&quot;: &quot;higher&quot;, &quot;good&quot;: 0.95, &quot;bad&quot;: 0.8, &quot;w&quot;: 0.3 }&#10;        ]&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;key&quot;: &quot;quality&quot;,&#10;        &quot;weight&